 and  pharmacy with all the information that  they need to be able to help treat and  change therapy for these patients as  needed  so in conclusion  as you've heard me discuss throughout  the talk the sepsi typer kit is an  extreme asset for us here at leahey used  as a frontline method for our positive  blood cultures  the results are determined within  minutes i mean we're talking you know a  good 20 minutes compared to the 24 to 48  hours  once that blood culture flags positive  due to the fda clearance we are now able  to report 488 organisms and not have to  have a presumptive id we don't have to  go back the next day and do a maldi to  confirm it  it definitely provides actionable  results for our closing clinicians in a  timely manner as well as our pharmacy  it's decreasing the hospital length of  stay by two and a half days  we definitely decrease the amount of  biochemicals that we order so this is  another significant savings  and  as well as the savings that we have  using molecular  and then it is a great tool for our  antimicrobial stewardship  and these are just the products that i  discussed just a quick review so it is  the maldi biotyper  system in the sepsi typer kit  we do use it on the clinical application  side  and that's  all i have to say it's a wonderful tool  for our hospital we don't know what we  would do without this  we love it it's great  i just cannot say enough about this so i  thank you for your attendance thank you  for letting me come today to discuss the  model top and at this point i will take  any questions that are out there and do  my best to answer them  all right thank you felicia for your  informative presentation we will now  start the live q a portion of the  webinar if you have a question you'd  like to ask please do so now just click  on the ask a question box located on the  far left of your screen we'll answer as  many of your questions as we have time  for  let's get started our first question is  does your lab us